i mesi alcuni malviventi seminano il terrore a Parigi. Chi riuscirà a sgominare la temibile banda diventerà capo della Polizia Giudiziaria, che ha sede al numero 36 di Quai des Orfèvres. La guerra tra Léo Vrinks, capo della squadra anticrimine e Denis Klein, che dirige la squadra investgativa, è così aperta.","tagline":"Tradimenti e vendette all'ombra della centrale di Polizia."},{"language":"en-US","title":"36th Precinct","overview":"In Paris, two cops are competing for the vacant job of chief of police, in the middle of the search for a gang of violent thieves. The movie is directed by Olivier Marchal, a former police officer who spent 12 years with the French police before creating this story, taken in part from real events of the 1980s.","tagline":"Revenge is not justice."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Paris. Depuis plusieurs mois, un gang de braqueurs opère en toute impunité avec une rare violence. Le directeur de la PJ, Robert Mancini a été parfaitement clair avec ses deux lieutenants les plus directs, Léo Vrinks, patron de la BRI (Brigade de Recherche et d’Intervention), et Denis Klein, patron de la BRB (Brigade de Répression du Banditisme) : celui qui fera tomber ce gang le remplacera à son poste de grand « patron » du 36, quai des Orfèvres. La lutte est ouverte entre ces deux grands flics, autrefois amis, qu’aujourd’hui tout sépare : leurs vies, leurs méthodes, leurs équipes et une femme, Camille Vrinks…","tagline":"La vengeance n’est pas la justice."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lTs3Hn2MlV2YdIV2f2HZb5wxZs.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5lTs3Hn2MlV2YdIV2f2HZb5wxZs.png","language":"it","width":593,"height":238},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/puikn4hhLEB7x4a4z1pvj0fPGkh.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/puikn4hhLEB7x4a4z1pvj0fPGkh.png","language":"fr","width":3000,"height":1475},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xGmZ7Tr